::  modules/harness/glow/gate-api-airlock.glow -- Ephemeral API Airlock!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-api-lease-window
  |=  [now=@ud exp=@ud https=@ud wiped=@ud]             ::  TTL, TLS, & wipe
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified wipe=1
  ~|  'pond-api-airlock-ttl-https-or-zeroize-breach'    ::  sanctuary law
  ?>  &(lth(now exp) eql(https 1) eql(wiped 1))
  wiped
--
